      "text": "Brief\n\n• White content, soft sky tint sections, ink CTA + footer\n• Fraunces headlines, Instrument Sans body, Plex Mono labels\n• node › bond › block as a refined accent: small markers, fine-line icons\n• Imagery = example data visuals of the diagnostic, always labelled\n• Dashed boxes = placeholders for real results, photos, bio",
