    "v4-changes": {
      "x": 10640,
      "y": 620,
      "w": 560,
      "fill": "teal",
      "size": "s",
      "text": "v4 · WHAT CHANGED (19 Nov, from review 2)\n\n• Desktop and mobile are now built from the same source, so copy and components can't drift apart again.\n• Home: new headline carried through (problem, results, CTA). New 'Why compound.' section: three one-line contrasts. 'Why it works' is one line introducing How we work. Hero card label is now 'Example finding'.\n• Principles on Home and About only. Approach links to them, Step 4 trimmed, step labels match ('01 · node.').\n• Services hub: hero card removed (the map does that job). Map group labels raised to 11px.\n• About: founder straight after the hero, with logos inside it. 'Why the name' folded into the definition card.\n• Request page: 'Free growth check' up top, plus 'You'll speak to [NAME]'.\n• Service pages rebuilt on one template: service-specific evidence headings, plain-English chips, neutral tiles, matching cards and buttons, chart labels fixed, proper case-study block.\n• Mobile: one spacing rhythm (64px sections, 48px hero top), principles and pairings stacked, only the homepage services swipe, two-column footer.\n• Frame heights measured by rendering each page."
    },
    "v4-todo": {
      "x": 11280,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 520,
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": "s",
      "text": "STILL NEEDED FROM YOU (updated 20 Nov)\n\nDone: founder name (James Rose), brands worked with (Yankee Candle, Nisbets, Oak Furnitureland, Lovehoney), reply time (one working day), pricing and length removed (‘shaped around you’), £500k–£10m removed.\n\n• Founder: portrait, story, LinkedIn, location, and the two stats ([XX] years, £[XX]m).\n• Proof: TBC, no clients yet. Results, testimonial and case-study blocks are still placeholders, so decide whether to hide them at launch.\n• Email address and company number.\n• Optional: calendar embed on the Thank-you page; use the Anim-Build animation somewhere."
    },
    "v4-mobile": {
      "x": 5640,
      "y": 15800,
      "w": 440,
      "fill": "teal",
      "size": "s",
      "text": "MOBILE · v4\n\nGenerated from the same source as desktop, so every change lands on both. One spacing rhythm, stacked principles and pairings, a swipe row only for the homepage services, and a two-column footer. The Services hub embeds the phone-sized map (Mobile · Asset · Service map)."
    }
